WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:02.850
Professor...

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.580
You're getting married, aren't you?

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:11.110
This wedding is something 
I have agreed to, of course.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.860
Even though the person 
you're marrying... is Charles Arbor?

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.940
Then, will you marry me instead, Rio?

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:23.370
Or will you take me somewhere and
live the rest of your life with me?

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.300
Celia...

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:29.990
<i>I am...</i>

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:31.890
<i>a doll.</i>

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:36.090
Halt!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.680
Seize him!

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.180
You little...

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.150
Who is this guy?

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.480
Seize him! Now!

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.280
Fall back to the side and 
form a single-file wall!

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.190
Don't let him get close!

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.620
Mage squad, contain him!

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.080
Photon Bullet!

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:13.920
This is bad!

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:15.970
Protect the bride and groom!

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:18.640
Enchant Physical Ability!

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.730
Encircle and capture him!

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:25.520
Sir!

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:28.650
Everything is fine, Celia.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.100
This is just a nice show before the ceremony.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.330
They are the elite among 
the elite of our kingdom,

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:38.560
the chosen few with proven 
pedigrees and skills.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:47.660
No lawless brigand could 
possibly hope to topple...

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:03.680
Um...

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.160
Seirei Gensouki

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.160
Seirei Gensouki

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.780
Celia!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.160
Count Claire, please wait!

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.340
That fool.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.830
Bringing disgrace upon my house...

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.080
Duke Arbor!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.160
Unhand me!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.000
The security for this was 
supposed to be flawless!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.990
We will do everything we can.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:59.090
So, please, don't provoke the insurgent.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:00.760
My lord Count!

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:05.230
Professor Celia...

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:08.350
I apologize for the disturbance,

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.850
but while those around us are in turmoil, 
I'd like to explain the situation.

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:15.150
If you would keep quiet for a little 
while, it would be a great help.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:17.710
Rio, what is going on?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.850
I am speaking directly into your 
consciousness through telepathy.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:27.580
Focus your words in your mind
 and your voice will reach me.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.620
Y-You villain...

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.250
What do you want here?

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.260
Silence!

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:35.050
I have a grievance with you!

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:38.780
Maybe I'll just go ahead and 
crush your spine under my foot!

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.780
H-Hold on, Rio!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:46.070
I won't kill anyone. This is an act,
 part of the disturbance.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.970
A-All right...

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:53.430
<i>Why is he... so strong?</i>

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.940
We don't have much time. 
I'll finish explaining quickly.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:57.940
Take the guests into the inner sanctum.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:02.230
Before you are wed, I want to ask 
once more, what is your will?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:06.510
Just for that, you've done all this...
 I told you already! I...

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.890
I said I want to know your will, Professor.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:14.960
You're being half-threatened into this 
by Duke Arbor's house, aren't you?

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.950
What is the security team doing?!

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:24.840
If you wish it, Professor, 
I will put an end to this wedding.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:27.510
You're being domineering!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:31.840
I know full well that I'm being 
domineering and arrogant.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:35.230
But, Professor, you are precious 
to me. I owe you so much.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:39.820
I don't want to just dstand by 
and lose what's important to me!

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:42.750
I know I'd regret it for the rest of my life.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:55.070
Once something is lost, 
it will never come back,

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:58.120
but if you haven't lost it yet, 
then there's still time!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:03.630
I see a future where your dignity will 
be trampled on for the rest of your life.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:05.680
I wouldn't be able stand that.

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:10.150
Professor, will this marriage make you happy?

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:17.180
If I put my own feelings before all else,

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.690
I may cause trouble for others.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:23.890
Would that... be the right thing to do?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:26.680
I don't know.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:31.610
But if this wedding were 
truly the right thing to do,

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.080
then you wouldn't have that look on your face.

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.300
Professor, I will make your wish come true.

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:40.850
So, please, don't give up!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:45.980
If I say I don't want to get married, 
what are you planning to do?

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.680
I will take you and run away from this place.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:53.850
That way, no one would question whether 
Count Claire was involved, right?

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.430
Why would that...

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.810
Rio, they'll catch you.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:07.030
Don't worry. I will make your 
wish come true, Professor.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:11.660
Though that isn't something someone holding 
a knife to your throat should be saying.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:16.440
Rio...

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:20.660
I... want you to take me away.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.590
Leave it to me.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:26.960
I've decided!

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.130
I made up my mind!

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.340
Feel the humiliation!

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:33.050
I will abduct your bride 
right before everyone's eyes!

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:37.680
Here we go.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:43.060
Celia!

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:46.000
L-Lord Charles!

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.730
C-Celia!

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:50.850
<i>I-I'm so sorry, father.</i>

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:53.700
<i>I promise I'll see you again.</i>

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:58.200
What are you doing? Hurry up and capture him!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.080
All troops, after him!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:00.950
Hold!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:02.960
Do not break formation!

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.710
You lot, catch him immediately!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.050
Charge!

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:08.210
Sir!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.210
It can't be!

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:10.550
What?

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:14.470
H-Halt!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.690
Wh-What are you doing?

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.250
Are you all incompetent?

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.220
This was his intent from the beginning.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:23.980
Didn't you see his jumping 
ability when he charged in?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.690
Photon Bullet!

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:32.950
<i>What's this?</i>

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:36.890
<i>I thought he was using some kind 
of magic item, but... spirit arts?</i>

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:39.870
<i>Could he have been the one back then...</i>

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:51.880
<i>He's gotten stronger since 
the last time I saw him.</i>

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.930
<i>In that case, how about this?</i>

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.520
Celia!

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:07.130
<i>Impressive.</i>

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.320
What are you doing?

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.360
Stop firing! What if you hit Celia?

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.870
After him! Catch him!

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:18.040
Everyone, listen up!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.920
Our Aerial Knights are now in pursuit.

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:27.710
All forces will now immediately spread 
out in a net that encircles the capital!

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.880
S-Sir! Right away!

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:34.180
And I will leave the security of 
these grounds to you, Vanessa.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.250
Coordinate between the captains of each unit.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:38.930
Show me how well you keep things moving.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.900
Sir! Understood, Elder Brother!

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.600
Alfred!

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:48.230
You've let the raider get away. 
Who gave you permission to take command?!

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:53.190
More importantly, do you have any 
idea who the insurgent might be?

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.450
He said he had a grievance with me.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.450
It sounds like there may be a lot of candidates.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.180
S-Silence!

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.200
You go and chase him, too! Immediately!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.810
Catch him and bring him back!

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.250
That is my intent.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.100
Well, then...

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.760
Blast.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.800
Blast. Blast! Blast him!

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:19.580
<i>This has become quite an 
entertaining situation,</i>

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.800
<i>but with the protections afforded 
to me as an ambassador,</i>

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.810
<i>I suppose I shouldn't slip away from here.</i>

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:31.710
<i>I am very interested in him, and that 
spirit that never showed itself, though.</i>

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.240
W-Wait, Rio!

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:43.620
This is fast. We're going 
very fast, aren't we?

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.760
Yes. Please be sure to hold on tightly.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:52.650
I'd rather not deal with griffin unit, 
so I'm going to go a little faster.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.000
A-All right.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.090
You've grown into quite an impressive boy.

00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:02.340
Thank you very much.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:05.040
Have you gotten a little 
more used to this speed?

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:08.350
Yup! If you can go faster, bring it on!

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.230
Huh?

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:11.510
Did you hear that just now, too?

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:13.270
Then I'll take you at your word.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:21.850
Even if I keep running like this, 
it will take time to shake them off,

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:23.400
so we'll head down for a moment.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:27.330
I'll be passing on the baton, 
so we'll meet up again later.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:33.170
P-Passing on the baton? And what 
do you mean, "meet up later"?

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:35.010
It's part of the plan.

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:37.170
The truth is, I have someone helping me.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.740
The girl who first spoke 
to you telepathically.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:50.700
Aishia!

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:55.920
Then, just as we planned it.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.460
Understood.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:58.660
Wh-What?

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.690
Wait! What's going on?

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:04.190
I'll play decoy and buy some time.

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:09.070
Professor, you and she will use this chance 
to escape the royal capital together.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.460
I promise I will meet up with you later.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:14.100
And to explain about this girl...

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.210
I'll explain on the way.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:17.990
That's that.

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:19.760
Look after her for me.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.470
W-Wait, Rio!

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:22.670
I...

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.820
Shall we go, Celia?

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.510
Yes.

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:33.520
There he is!

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:36.860
But I don't see Lady Celia!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.850
The alley he came out of is a dead end!

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:41.400
Inform the teams on the ground!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.400
Send up a flare!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.260
Sir!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.820
Signal Flare!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:52.290
<i>They've called for reinforcements. 
It's going just as we planned.</i>

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:55.580
<i>All that's left is for me to make 
a big show in drawing them away.</i>

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:57.580
Blitz Shot!

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:10.850
He's so quick at evading!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.760
Continue the attack!

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:14.370
Blitz Shot!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.820
Over there! Let's go!

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.360
Like I'd let you!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.050
<i>There really are a lot of them.</i>

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.540
Don't give him a chance to rest!

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.940
Reinforcements are coming. 
Let's wear him down as much as we can!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.130
Let's do it!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.870
<i>Not killing anyone... 
might be making this tougher.</i>

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:11.830
<i>But...</i>

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.500
<i>I just told Professor Celia not to give up.</i>

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.300
<i>I can't give up now!</i>

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:18.790
That's as far as you go.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:21.000
I will now restrain you.

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.000
Lord Alfred!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.840
<i>Alfred?</i>

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.550
<i>He's the one they call the 
King's Sword, isn't he?</i>

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:33.530
You will only add to the number of injured.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.980
All of you, stand back.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:36.850
Sir!

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:55.740
<i>He's strong.</i>

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:14.050
<i>There's some kind of powerful 
magic formula cast on that sword.</i>

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:36.990
L-Lord Alfred is being pushed back...

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.340
Why do you not turn your blades on me?

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.510
It seems you underestimate me.

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:57.650
But that ends now.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.530
Lord Alfred!

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:26.250
I don't see the insurgent anywhere.
 What happened to him?

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:30.900
<i>If he took the full force of the blow, 
not a trace of him would be left, but...</i>

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:33.990
<i>I didn't feel it hit him.</i>

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.720
<i>And there's evidence he 
fled into the back streets.</i>

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.220
Just to be sure, search the surrounding area!

00:16:40.070 --> 00:16:41.780
And we'll look for Miss Celia as well!

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.560
Sir!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:19.260
Aishia... Rio is all right, isn't he?

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.770
He's fine. He's almost here.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:31.230
Aishia?

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.150
Is he really all right?

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.260
I've just returned.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:44.870
Rio! I'm so glad!

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:52.650
I know I worried you, but everything 
is all right now, Professor.

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:54.860
Y-Yes.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.280
Rio, you aren't hurt, are you?

00:17:58.280 --> 00:17:59.420
No, I'm not.

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:00.470
And Aishia...

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.910
Thank you.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:05.670
Not at all. I didn't do 
anything of importance.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.100
Well, shall we go?

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.470
Yes.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.150
Is this really all right?

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:14.970
Do you want to go back?

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.710
You could still make it in time, but...

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:19.990
What? N-No!

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:26.000
I was just thinking it doesn't 
feel real, that's all.

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:31.960
After all, for a moment my future was 
so bleak, I thought my life was over.

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:36.980
But you're here with me now, Rio.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:40.970
Thank you, Rio, for kidnapping me!

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:42.970
You're very welcome.

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.690
We'll have to think about 
what we're going to do next.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.380
Yes, that's true.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:55.480
Professor Celia, I have something 
I absolutely must do.

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:01.960
But I won't let you suffer for lack of 
anything when it comes to daily necessities.

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:03.490
Rest assured on that point.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:06.620
I see.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:10.430
Well then, I suppose I'll take 
you up on that for a while.

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:14.420
I am inexperienced and inept, 
but I hope you will look on me kindly.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.930
I am the one who hopes you 
will look on me kindly.

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:19.910
And...

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:23.930
Let's talk a lot to make up for all 
the time we didn't see each other!

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:25.930
Yes, let's!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.270
<i>It's coming.</i>

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:05.510
Aishia?

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.020
Haruto, please, help them!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:10.900
What?

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.520
I will protect Celia.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.070
Please!

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:52.330
Masato, where are we?

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.540
Don't ask me!

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:58.930
W-Well... for now, shall we 
try to find out where we are?

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:02.550
<b>No Service</b>

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:01.230
No service?

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.240
That hurts!

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.240
No!

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:08.480
Masato-kun!

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:09.930
No! Someone, help!

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:09.930
Aki-neechan!

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:11.930
Please, don't do anything 
horrible with those children!

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:15.060
You go in a different cart. This way.

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:22.360
One of your guards was carrying this.

